  "versionMetadata": {
    "description": "Finance Tracker AI helps you stay in control of everyday money with intelligent tools for budgeting and planning.\n\nTrack expenses and income, manage recurring bills and subscriptions, scan receipts, and understand spending with clear charts. Ask the financial AI to propose transaction, budget, and recurring-payment updates, then review every change before it is applied.\n\nSecure user-scoped cloud storage keeps your information synced across sessions, while a fast and clean interface makes everyday budgeting easier.\n\nThe app interface is currently in English.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://agentscix.com/apps/finance-tracker/privacy",
    "promotionalText": "Track spending, scan receipts, and ask Finance AI to propose budget or transaction changes—nothing is applied until you approve it.",
    "whatsNew": "This update expands App Store localization and search coverage, with additional reliability, cloud sync, and AI request improvements."
  },
